<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήθαιος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληθαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήθη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>causing forgetfulness</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερόν</span>, of Sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				234
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκότος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1127
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			persons, <i>oblivious</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμφρων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>from Lethe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.279
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Bass.
			</span></i>); v.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. λίθος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελιτίτης λ.</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				476
			</span></i> ed. Sarac.</div>
